118	// `drain_at_exit=1`), the plugin registers a per-insn exec callback that
119	// bumps `atexit_insn_count`, and a `qemu_plugin_register_atexit_cb` that
120	// drains state on natural program exit (e.g. semihosting EXIT). The
121	// atexit callback overrides s.minstret with the plugin counter so the
122	// caller (./hsim estimate --icount 0) gets a true retired-insn count
123	// independent of QEMU's PMU semantics (which can return host ticks on
124	// system-mode without `-icount`). `drained_already` suppresses the
125	// atexit path if any other trigger (CSR/PC/icount/slice) drained first.
126	static int      drain_at_exit_mode;
